# playMoveSound(Player player)
# Plays the "piece moved" sound for non-capture moves (quiet,
# double-push, castle landing). Capture moves play playCaptureSound
# instead - they're mutually exclusive in applyMoveVisually.
# CHANGE the sound name below.

@using rychess
@fast

@bypass /playsound minecraft:block.stone.place master @a[x=-9134.0,y=-61.0,z=9669.0,distance=..20] -9134.0 -61.0 9669.0 1 1
